title: "rnel: Refined Neutrosophic Evidential Logic"
abstract: "A toolkit for neutrosophic evidence: evidence tuples, Subjective Logic, credal and conflict diagnostics, refined neutrosophic statistics, DSmT, plithogenic and copula operators, learning utilities, and reproducible book computations."
